    "description": "I'm a Software Engineer with <strong>4 years of industry experience</strong>, a Bachelor of Science in Computer Engineering, and I'm currently pursuing a PhD in Computer Science. Throughout my career, I've worked across both <strong>back-end</strong> and <strong>front-end</strong> development, with a strong focus on designing scalable, reliable, and maintainable back-end systems.<br><br>My primary technologies include <strong>Java, Spring Boot, Python, AWS, TypeScript, and Angular</strong>. I also have experience with automated testing, continuous integration, cloud-based applications, and software architecture, always aiming to build high-quality solutions that are efficient, maintainable, and user-focused.<br><br>Alongside my professional work, I'm pursuing research in Artificial Intelligence as part of my PhD. Since my undergraduate studies, research has been a significant part of my journey, allowing me to explore emerging technologies, contribute to the scientific community, and bridge the gap between academic research and industry practice.",
